摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Always-on supervisor agent bundle for DeepSeek Harness: main-agent preset + schedule overlay, one dsh plugin add away","id":"gh:1342616200","install_available":true,"language":"HTML","name":"dsh-supervisor","slug":"dat-lequoc/dsh-supervisor","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Always-on supervisor agent bundle for DeepSeek Harness: main-agent preset + schedule overlay, one ds"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"sor agent bundle for DeepSeek Harness: main-agent preset + schedule overlay, one dsh plugin add away"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-supervisor — an Always-On Supervisor Agent for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A 24/7 **Main Agent** that records a reviewable goal, then loops unattended: spawn a dev\nsubagent → "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"sleep → wake on settle / report / timer / your message → inspect → steer,\nkill, or continue. Built *"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"*native-first** on DeepSeek Harness\n(dsh): the core is one agent preset, a persona, and one schedule"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"-service row — zero custom\nloop machinery. This repo **is an installable dsh plugin bundle**: one co"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"mmand puts the\nwhole setup on any machine running dsh."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Tested end-to-end on `glm-5.3` (Z.AI): goal setup, grounded delegation, mid-flight\nsteering, a mid-t"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"urn kill + tighter respawn, the silent-question → recorded-assumption\nflow, deliverable verification"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" (it caught its own buggy link-checker and re-ran it),\nand full process-restart resume. Grader score"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"s: m0–m5 and m7 at 100%."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Run the local course on a new PC"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Install Git and Python 3, clone this repository, then run its course launcher:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The launcher keeps its environment under `tutorial/.venv`, installs the grader-only Python dependenc"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ies, selects\nan unused `127.0.0.1` port, and prints the tutorial URL. Its local server powers the gr"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ade\nbuttons embedded in each milestone. It intentionally does not install dsh, clone DeepSeek Harnes"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"s,\nconfigure a model, or create workspaces; the setup chapter teaches those steps explicitly."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install the supervisor (chapter 6)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Prerequisites: Node.js 22.19+ in the 22.x line, or Node.js 24+, and dsh\n(`npm i -g @deepseek-ai/dsh`"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"), with a model configured (web UI → Settings → Models;\ntested with Z.AI `glm-5.3`)."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"That's the whole install. The one command registers the package as a **profile bundle**\n(dependency "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"+ `dsh.profile.bundles` entry), and at boot the bundle:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. mounts the schedule service (`dsh-schedule`) the supervisor's timers need\n(no `dsh-time-context` "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"— it would inject a timestamp block into every request,\nand Schedule does not depend on it), and\n2. "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"runs this package's setup plugin (`lib/index.js`), which installs the bundled\n**`main-agent` preset*"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"* into `${DSH_HOME:-~/.dsh}/.agent-presets/` — only if absent,\nnever clobbering your edits (row conf"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"ig `syncPreset: always | if-absent | never`)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then create a workspace for the supervisor's state:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Alternative: manual install without the plugin manager"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"`./scripts/install-manual.sh ~/agi-lab` copies the preset into the user preset root\nand writes the s"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"chedule rows into your profile's `cordis.patch.yml` instead. Use ONE\npath, not both — the schedule s"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ervice registers once per process, so the bundle rows\nand manual patch rows must not coexist. If you"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"r profile already mounts\n`dsh-schedule` from elsewhere, disable this bundle's copy with an id-target"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ed\n`disabled: true` patch on `agi-schedule`."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Run"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Open http://127.0.0.1:3080 → new session → workspace `~/agi-lab` → preset\n**Main Agent (Supervisor)*"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"* → give it a mission, e.g.:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> Goal: produce SUMMARY.md describing the layout of `<some docs dir>` — delegate the\n> work, supervi"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"uce SUMMARY.md describing the layout of `<some docs dir>` — delegate the\n> work, supervise, deliver."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"What you should see, in order: it **grounds** by reading the durable mission state\nand relevant work"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"space runbooks/scripts, calls `start_goal` to write `.agi/GOAL.md`\nand arm the native goal immediate"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ly, then continues in the same turn. No generated\nconfirmation phrase or second human reply is requi"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"red. It then calls the guarded\n`subagent` tool with a complete structured task and an explicit Setti"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"ngs-approved model route,\narms a recurring check-in reminder, and sleeps. It wakes on the worker's s"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"ettle\nnotice, **verifies the deliverable with its own reads**, logs everything to\n`.agi/CHANGELOG.js"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"onl`, and continues or finishes. You steer at any time by chatting;\nworkers are ordinary sessions in"},{"id":"p21s8","text":" the sidebar — click one to watch it live."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Reviewable, non-blocking goal frontend"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The preset deliberately disables Harness's native model-facing\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-goal` row. Tha"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"t frontend permits `create_goal` to infer\nlong-running intent without first checking durable mission"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" state or workspace\nrunbooks. `dsh-supervisor/goal` replaces only that\nfrontend; the native `ctx.goa"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"ls` service, session projection and race-fenced\ngoal-round driver remain installed on the host."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The replacement exposes `get_goal`, `start_goal`, and `update_goal`. `start_goal`\nis available only "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"to the root agent in a direct human turn and only after that\nturn calls `get_goal`. It captures obje"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ctive, constraints, milestones,\nout-of-scope and the autonomous round cap in canonical `GOAL.md`, ca"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"lls the native\ngoal service immediately, and returns to the same model turn so work continues.\nThe g"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"enerated document is for visibility and steering, not an approval gate: the\nhuman can inspect it and"},{"id":"p24s6","text":" redirect, pause, or stop through ordinary chat.\n`update_goal` deliberately omits `edit`; pause, res"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"ume, completion, blocking\nthresholds, native revisions, projections and automatic continuation retai"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"n their\nHarness behavior."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Worker failures are reported only when the native continuable child has actually\nsettled. The superv"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"isor preserves that single wake and enriches it from the child's\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## What's in this repo"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Path | What |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| `package.json` + `cordis.patch.yml` + `lib/` | The dsh bundle: manifest (`dsh.bundle.patch` + `dsh"},{"id":"p28s2","text":".client`), the inserted rows, setup/routes, non-blocking native-goal frontend, final-settlement diag"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"nostics, and the browser half (`lib/client.js`: Feed tab, Full stop, settings card) |\n| `agent-prese"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ts/main-agent/` | The supervisor preset: persona (grounding, non-blocking goal setup, loop, question"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"s), plugin-owned goal frontend, and the sole settings-guarded `subagent` worker row |\n| `agi-templat"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"e/` | The `.agi/config.json` template for a new workspace |\n| `tutorial/` | The self-contained 15-st"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"ep course app: HTML/CSS/JS, setup/server, private requirements, grading UI/CLI, milestone grader, an"},{"id":"p28s8","text":"d optional headless driver |\n| `scripts/install-manual.sh` | Non-bundle fallback installer |\n| `DESI"},{"id":"p28s9","text":"GN.md` / `IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` | The design record (Q1–Q23, A1–A6, S1–S4, N1–N7, G1) and the v2 p"},{"id":"p28s10","text":"` / `IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` | The design record (Q1–Q23, A1–A6, S1–S4, N1–N7, G1) and the v2 plan |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
